    "detailed_description": "\ud83c\udf1f Dive into the Ultimate Shogi Experience !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnearth the magic of Shogi (\u5c06\u68cb, sh\u014dgi) \u2013 Japan's treasure of strategic gameplay, revered as their version of Chess. Engage in thrilling battles on a board where every move tells a story. 'Sh\u014dgi', translating to the general's (sh\u014d \u5c06) board game (gi \u68cb), is a testament to its captivating legacy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWitness the unique charm of Shogi: the strategic genius of deploying captured pieces back onto the board, a twist that has captivated enthusiasts since its ancient inception.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndorsed by legendary player Yoshiharu Habu, Shogi isn't just Japan's favorite pastime \u2013 it's a masterpiece of art. A symphony that harmonizes seamlessly with the traditional echoes of haiku, tanka, noh, ikebana, and the soulful Japanese tea ceremony. Its illustrious stature is carved by the age-old iemoto system, bolstered by historical shogunate backing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf96 Features that Elevate Your Shogi Adventure:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Crafted Undo: Strategize with freedom!<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcbc Game Save/Load: Your game, on your time.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd22 Skill Spectrum: Embark on journeys from beginner to maestro with 5 tailored difficulty levels.<br />\r\n\u23f3 Beat the Clock: Thrill in timer-driven confrontations.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Your Board, Your Rules: Customize with a robust board editor.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Aural Pleasure: Dive deep with tailored sound effects.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Diverse Gameplay: Westernized pieces, multiple piece sets, and board designs to choose from.<br />\r\nJoin the ranks of Shogi connoisseurs. Immerse in an unparalleled blend of strategy, art, and tradition. Your board awaits.",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83c\udf1f Dive into the Ultimate Shogi Experience !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnearth the magic of Shogi (\u5c06\u68cb, sh\u014dgi) \u2013 Japan's treasure of strategic gameplay, revered as their version of Chess. Engage in thrilling battles on a board where every move tells a story. 'Sh\u014dgi', translating to the general's (sh\u014d \u5c06) board game (gi \u68cb), is a testament to its captivating legacy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWitness the unique charm of Shogi: the strategic genius of deploying captured pieces back onto the board, a twist that has captivated enthusiasts since its ancient inception.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndorsed by legendary player Yoshiharu Habu, Shogi isn't just Japan's favorite pastime \u2013 it's a masterpiece of art. A symphony that harmonizes seamlessly with the traditional echoes of haiku, tanka, noh, ikebana, and the soulful Japanese tea ceremony. Its illustrious stature is carved by the age-old iemoto system, bolstered by historical shogunate backing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf96 Features that Elevate Your Shogi Adventure:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Crafted Undo: Strategize with freedom!<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcbc Game Save/Load: Your game, on your time.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd22 Skill Spectrum: Embark on journeys from beginner to maestro with 5 tailored difficulty levels.<br />\r\n\u23f3 Beat the Clock: Thrill in timer-driven confrontations.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Your Board, Your Rules: Customize with a robust board editor.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Aural Pleasure: Dive deep with tailored sound effects.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Diverse Gameplay: Westernized pieces, multiple piece sets, and board designs to choose from.<br />\r\nJoin the ranks of Shogi connoisseurs. Immerse in an unparalleled blend of strategy, art, and tradition. Your board awaits.",
